WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.975
Drone systems combine aircraft safety with account, software, communications,

00:00:03.975 --> 00:00:05.266
and data security.

00:00:05.266 --> 00:00:10.863
Protect controller and application accounts with unique passwords and multi-factor authentication where available.

00:00:10.863 --> 00:00:13.877
Remove former users and limit administrative privileges.

00:00:13.877 --> 00:00:17.321
Maintain firmware and applications through an approved process.

00:00:17.321 --> 00:00:21.627
Review significant changes before operational use and confirm settings afterward.

00:00:21.627 --> 00:00:24.210
Updates can improve security and reliability,

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:29.807
but an untested change immediately before a critical mission may create operational uncertainty.

00:00:29.807 --> 00:00:34.112
Collected imagery can reveal people, homes, routines, access points, infrastructure,

00:00:34.112 --> 00:00:35.404
or sensitive operations.

00:00:35.404 --> 00:00:39.278
Restrict access, use encrypted storage and transfer where appropriate,

00:00:39.278 --> 00:00:43.584
and retain only what the legitimate mission and policy require.

00:00:43.584 --> 00:00:45.306
Respect privacy and property.

00:00:45.306 --> 00:00:50.472
Notify or obtain consent where required, avoid private areas and unnecessary identification,

00:00:50.472 --> 00:00:54.347
and position sensors to collect the minimum useful data.

00:00:54.347 --> 00:00:58.652
A technically legal flight can still be intrusive or unethical.

00:00:58.652 --> 00:01:03.819
Do not use drones for harassment, stalking, unlawful surveillance, interference with aircraft,

00:01:03.819 --> 00:01:06.832
evasion of law enforcement, or unsafe activity.

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:10.277
Do not bypass flight restrictions or conceal accountability.

00:01:10.277 --> 00:01:15.012
Security and public-safety missions still require defined authority and proportional controls.

00:01:15.012 --> 00:01:18.887
Ethical operation asks whether the mission is necessary, proportionate,

00:01:18.887 --> 00:01:22.331
and explainable to affected people and accountable reviewers.

00:01:22.331 --> 00:01:27.067
Protect sensitive findings, document decisions, and stop when safety, authority, privacy,

00:01:27.067 --> 00:01:29.220
or trust cannot be maintained.
